<%# 打刻修正申請の比較表（今の記録／承認前の記録 と 申請内容）。申請者の詳細と承認画面の詳細で使う %>
<section class="card card--flush section" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
  <div class="card__header">
    <h2 id="comparison-title" class="card__title card__title--small">内容（<%= correction_comparison_base_label(correction) %>と申請内容）</h2>
    <p class="muted card__header-lead"><%= correction_comparison_lead(correction) %></p>
  </div>
  <table class="table correction-comparison" data-testid="correction-comparison">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">項目</th>
        <th scope="col" data-testid="comparison-base-label"><%= correction_comparison_base_label(correction) %></th>
        <th scope="col">申請内容</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <% correction_comparison_rows(correction).each do |row| %>
        <tr class="<%= "is-changed" if row[:changed] %>" data-item="<%= row[:label] %>">
          <th scope="row">
            <%= row[:label] %>
            <% if row[:changed] %><span class="badge badge--accent">変更</span><% end %>
          </th>
          <td data-column="current"><%= row[:current] %></td>
          <td data-column="requested" class="correction-comparison__requested"><%= row[:requested] %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>
